<section id="cs-use-cases" class="cs-uc" aria-labelledby="cs-use-cases-title">
	<div class="cs-uc-intro">
<p class="cs-eyebrow cs-rise">Where it fits</p>
		<h2 id="cs-use-cases-title" class="cs-rise cs-rise-d1">If this sounds like your week, we can help.</h2>
		<p class="cs-uc-intro-text cs-rise cs-rise-d2">These are the problems we hear most. Yours may look a little different, and that is fine, because every system we build is shaped around the business it serves.</p>
	</div>

	<div class="cs-uc-grid">
		<article class="cs-uc-card cs-uc-tone-mist cs-rise cs-rise-d1">
			<div class="cs-uc-card-top">
				<span class="cs-uc-num">01</span>
				<span class="cs-uc-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
			</div>
			<div class="cs-uc-card-main">
				<div class="cs-uc-copy">
					<h3 class="cs-uc-title">Replace the spreadsheet</h3>
					<p class="cs-uc-desc">Orders, stock or records kept in spreadsheets that only one person really understands. We turn them into a system the whole team can use safely, with the right people seeing the right things.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="cs-uc-chips"><span class="cs-uc-chip">Records</span><span class="cs-uc-chip">Reports</span><span class="cs-uc-chip">Access control</span></div>
			</div>
			<div class="cs-uc-card-foot">
				<p class="cs-uc-replaces"><span class="cs-uc-replaces-label">Replaces::</span> <span>Spreadsheets and paper registers</span></p>
				<a class="cs-uc-link" href="/quote" data-quote aria-label="Talk to us about this: Replace the spreadsheet">Talk to us about this <svg class="cs-uc-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4" /></svg></a>
			</div>
		</article>
		<article class="cs-uc-card cs-uc-tone-teal cs-rise cs-rise-d2">
			<div class="cs-uc-card-top">
				<span class="cs-uc-num">02</span>
				<span class="cs-uc-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
			</div>
			<div class="cs-uc-card-main">
				<div class="cs-uc-copy">
					<h3 class="cs-uc-title">Run the field</h3>
					<p class="cs-uc-desc">Staff out visiting customers, collecting payments or capturing data need an app that works on a weak network and syncs when the signal returns.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="cs-uc-chips"><span class="cs-uc-chip">Mobile app</span><span class="cs-uc-chip">Works offline</span><span class="cs-uc-chip">Live updates</span></div>
			</div>
			<div class="cs-uc-card-foot">
				<p class="cs-uc-replaces"><span class="cs-uc-replaces-label">Replaces::</span> <span>Phone calls and end of day reports</span></p>
				<a class="cs-uc-link" href="/quote" data-quote aria-label="Talk to us about this: Run the field">Talk to us about this <svg class="cs-uc-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4" /></svg></a>
			</div>
		</article>
		<article class="cs-uc-card cs-uc-tone-clay cs-rise cs-rise-d3">
			<div class="cs-uc-card-top">
				<span class="cs-uc-num">03</span>
				<span class="cs-uc-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
			</div>
			<div class="cs-uc-card-main">
				<div class="cs-uc-copy">
					<h3 class="cs-uc-title">Serve customers without the queue</h3>
					<p class="cs-uc-desc">Let customers book, check status, pay and download documents themselves, so your team stops answering the same questions all day.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="cs-uc-chips"><span class="cs-uc-chip">Customer portal</span><span class="cs-uc-chip">Payments</span><span class="cs-uc-chip">Notifications</span></div>
			</div>
			<div class="cs-uc-card-foot">
				<p class="cs-uc-replaces"><span class="cs-uc-replaces-label">Replaces::</span> <span>Repeated calls and walk in questions</span></p>
				<a class="cs-uc-link" href="/quote" data-quote aria-label="Talk to us about this: Serve customers without the queue">Talk to us about this <svg class="cs-uc-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4" /></svg></a>
			</div>
		</article>
		<article class="cs-uc-card cs-uc-tone-teal cs-rise cs-rise-d1">
			<div class="cs-uc-card-top">
				<span class="cs-uc-num">04</span>
				<span class="cs-uc-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
			</div>
			<div class="cs-uc-card-main">
				<div class="cs-uc-copy">
					<h3 class="cs-uc-title">Manage the team</h3>
					<p class="cs-uc-desc">Approvals, tasks, attendance and reports in one place, so managers can see what is happening without chasing people for updates.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="cs-uc-chips"><span class="cs-uc-chip">Dashboards</span><span class="cs-uc-chip">Approvals</span><span class="cs-uc-chip">Reports</span></div>
			</div>
			<div class="cs-uc-card-foot">
				<p class="cs-uc-replaces"><span class="cs-uc-replaces-label">Replaces::</span> <span>Chat threads and manual follow ups</span></p>
				<a class="cs-uc-link" href="/quote" data-quote aria-label="Talk to us about this: Manage the team">Talk to us about this <svg class="cs-uc-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4" /></svg></a>
			</div>
		</article>
		<article class="cs-uc-card cs-uc-tone-mist cs-rise cs-rise-d2">
			<div class="cs-uc-card-top">
				<span class="cs-uc-num">05</span>
				<span class="cs-uc-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
			</div>
			<div class="cs-uc-card-main">
				<div class="cs-uc-copy">
					<h3 class="cs-uc-title">Launch a new product</h3>
					<p class="cs-uc-desc">Have an idea for an app or a service? We help you decide what version one should include, then build it properly so you can start with real users.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="cs-uc-chips"><span class="cs-uc-chip">Web app</span><span class="cs-uc-chip">Mobile app</span><span class="cs-uc-chip">First version</span></div>
			</div>
			<div class="cs-uc-card-foot">
				<p class="cs-uc-replaces"><span class="cs-uc-replaces-label">Replaces::</span> <span>Guesswork about what to build first</span></p>
				<a class="cs-uc-link" href="/quote" data-quote aria-label="Talk to us about this: Launch a new product">Talk to us about this <svg class="cs-uc-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4" /></svg></a>
			</div>
		</article>
		<article class="cs-uc-card cs-uc-tone-neutral cs-rise cs-rise-d3">
			<div class="cs-uc-card-top">
				<span class="cs-uc-num">06</span>
				<span class="cs-uc-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
			</div>
			<div class="cs-uc-card-main">
				<div class="cs-uc-copy">
					<h3 class="cs-uc-title">Connect what you already use</h3>
					<p class="cs-uc-desc">Link payments, messaging, accounting and other tools so information moves by itself and nobody retypes the same data in three places.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="cs-uc-chips"><span class="cs-uc-chip">Integrations</span><span class="cs-uc-chip">APIs</span><span class="cs-uc-chip">Automation</span></div>
			</div>
			<div class="cs-uc-card-foot">
				<p class="cs-uc-replaces"><span class="cs-uc-replaces-label">Replaces::</span> <span>Retyping the same data everywhere</span></p>
				<a class="cs-uc-link" href="/quote" data-quote aria-label="Talk to us about this: Connect what you already use">Talk to us about this <svg class="cs-uc-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4" /></svg></a>
			</div>
		</article>
	</div>

<p class="cs-uc-end cs-rise">Does yours look different? <a href="/quote" data-quote>Tell us the problem</a></p>
</section>

<style>
	.cs-uc {
		scroll-margin-top: var(--header-h, 76px);
		padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
		background: transparent;
	}

	.cs-uc-intro {
		max-width: var(--container-inner);
		margin-inline: auto;
		padding: 0 24px;
	}

	.cs-eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		color: var(--kt-teal);
		font: 500 .75rem/1.2 var(--font-mono);
		letter-spacing: .14em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}
	.cs-eyebrow::before {
		display: inline-block;
		width: 2rem;
		height: 2px;
		margin-right: .65rem;
		vertical-align: middle;
		background: var(--kt-clay);
		content: '';
	}

	.cs-uc h2 {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--color-text);
		font: 600 clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3rem)/1.08 var(--font-heading);
		letter-spacing: -.03em;
	}
	.cs-uc h2::after {
		display: block;
		width: 2.5rem;
		height: 2px;
		margin-top: 1rem;
		background: var(--kt-clay);
		content: '';
	}

	.cs-uc-intro-text {
		margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
		max-width: 44rem;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		font-size: var(--fs-lead);
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	/* Airy card grid ---------------------------------------------------- */
	.cs-uc-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 1.5rem;
		max-width: var(--container-inner);
		margin: 2.5rem auto 0;
		padding: 0 24px;
	}

	.cs-uc-card {
		--uc-tint: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kt-mist) 35%, var(--color-card-bg));
		--uc-border: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kt-mist) 30%, transparent);
		--uc-chip-bg: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kt-cream) 55%, transparent);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		min-width: 0;
		padding: 1.75rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--uc-border);
		border-radius: 1.25rem;
		background: var(--uc-tint);
		box-shadow: 0 1px 2px color-mix(in srgb, var(--kt-indigo) 4%, transparent);
		transition: transform 250ms ease, border-color 250ms ease;
	}

	.cs-uc-tone-teal {
		--uc-tint: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kt-teal) 14%, var(--color-card-bg));
		--uc-border: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kt-teal) 30%, transparent);
	}
	.cs-uc-tone-clay {
		--uc-tint: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kt-clay) 10%, var(--color-card-bg));
		--uc-border: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kt-clay) 30%, transparent);
	}
	.cs-uc-tone-neutral {
		--uc-tint: var(--color-card-bg);
		--uc-border: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kt-mist) 45%, transparent);
	}

	:global([data-theme='dark']) .cs-uc-card {
		--uc-tint: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 6%, var(--color-bg));
		--uc-border: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 22%, transparent);
		--uc-chip-bg: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 8%, transparent);
		box-shadow: none;
	}
	:global([data-theme='dark']) .cs-uc-tone-teal {
		--uc-tint: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kt-teal-light) 12%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 6%, var(--color-bg)));
		--uc-border: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kt-teal-light) 22%, transparent);
	}
	:global([data-theme='dark']) .cs-uc-tone-clay {
		--uc-tint: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kt-clay-light) 10%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 6%, var(--color-bg)));
		--uc-border: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kt-clay-light) 22%, transparent);
	}
	:global([data-theme='dark']) .cs-uc-tone-neutral {
		--uc-border: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kt-mist) 22%, transparent);
	}

	.cs-uc-grid > .cs-uc-card:nth-child(1),
	.cs-uc-grid > .cs-uc-card:nth-child(6) {
		grid-column: span 2;
		padding: 2rem;
	}
	.cs-uc-grid > .cs-uc-card:nth-child(1) .cs-uc-title,
	.cs-uc-grid > .cs-uc-card:nth-child(6) .cs-uc-title {
		font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2vw, 1.85rem);
	}

	.cs-uc-card-top {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}
	.cs-uc-num {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		min-width: 2rem;
		height: 2rem;
		padding: 0 .35rem;
		border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-strong) 22%, transparent);
		border-radius: .65rem;
		background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 10%, transparent);
		color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-strong) 85%, var(--color-text));
		font: 500 .8rem/1 var(--font-mono);
		letter-spacing: .06em;
	}
	.cs-uc-tone-clay .cs-uc-num {
		border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kt-clay) 25%, transparent);
		background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kt-clay) 12%, transparent);
		color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-clay-ink) 80%, var(--color-text));
	}
	:global([data-theme='dark']) .cs-uc-tone-clay .cs-uc-num {
		border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kt-clay-light) 30%, transparent);
		color: var(--kt-clay-light);
	}
	.cs-uc-rule {
		flex: 1;
		height: 1px;
		background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 14%, transparent);
	}

	.cs-uc-card-main { display: grid; gap: 0; }
	.cs-uc-grid > .cs-uc-card:nth-child(1) .cs-uc-card-main,
	.cs-uc-grid > .cs-uc-card:nth-child(6) .cs-uc-card-main {
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, .85fr);
		align-items: start;
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.cs-uc-title {
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		color: var(--color-text);
		font: 600 clamp(1.25rem, 1.6vw, 1.5rem)/1.2 var(--font-heading);
		letter-spacing: -.01em;
	}
	.cs-uc-desc {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		font: 400 .95rem/1.65 var(--font-body);
	}

	.cs-uc-chips {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-content: start;
		gap: .5rem;
		margin-top: 1.25rem;
	}
	.cs-uc-grid > .cs-uc-card:nth-child(1) .cs-uc-chips,
	.cs-uc-grid > .cs-uc-card:nth-child(6) .cs-uc-chips { margin-top: 0; }
	.cs-uc-chip {
		display: inline-block;
		padding: .25rem .65rem;
		border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 16%, transparent);
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: var(--uc-chip-bg);
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		font: 500 .7rem/1.3 var(--font-mono);
		letter-spacing: .04em;
	}

	.cs-uc-card-foot {
		margin-top: auto;
		padding-top: 1.25rem;
		border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 12%, transparent);
	}
	.cs-uc-replaces {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		font: 500 .75rem/1.6 var(--font-mono);
		letter-spacing: .06em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}
	.cs-uc-replaces-label { color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-strong) 85%, var(--color-text)); letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
	:global([data-theme='dark']) .cs-uc-replaces-label { color: var(--kt-teal-light); }

	.cs-uc-link {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: .4rem;
		margin-top: 1rem;
		color: var(--color-accent-strong);
		font: 600 .9rem/1.4 var(--font-body);
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	.cs-uc-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: .3rem; }
	.cs-uc-arrow { width: 1rem; height: 1rem; flex: none; transition: transform 250ms ease; }

	@media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
		.cs-uc-card:hover {
			transform: translateY(-4px);
			border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 60%, transparent);
		}
		.cs-uc-card:hover .cs-uc-arrow { transform: translateX(3px); }
	}

	.cs-uc-end {
		max-width: var(--container-inner);
		margin: 2.5rem auto 0;
		padding: 0 24px;
		text-align: center;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		font-size: .95rem;
	}
	.cs-uc-end a {
		color: var(--color-accent-strong);
		font-weight: 600;
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-decoration-color: var(--kt-clay);
		text-underline-offset: .3rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 899px) and (min-width: 600px) {
		.cs-uc-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
	}
	@media (max-width: 599px) {
		.cs-uc-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
		.cs-uc-grid > .cs-uc-card:nth-child(1),
		.cs-uc-grid > .cs-uc-card:nth-child(6) { grid-column: auto; padding: 1.75rem; }
		.cs-uc-grid > .cs-uc-card:nth-child(1) .cs-uc-card-main,
		.cs-uc-grid > .cs-uc-card:nth-child(6) .cs-uc-card-main { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
		.cs-uc-grid > .cs-uc-card:nth-child(1) .cs-uc-chips,
		.cs-uc-grid > .cs-uc-card:nth-child(6) .cs-uc-chips { margin-top: 1.25rem; }
		.cs-uc-intro, .cs-uc-grid, .cs-uc-end { padding-inline: 20px; }
	}

	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.cs-uc-card, .cs-uc-arrow { transition: none; }
	}
</style>
